 `SIS_TERM_ADDRESS_CATEGORY`, `STUDENT_ETHNIC_SUBGROUP`, `FUND_CENTER_HIERARCHY`, `OPA_PERSON_CURRENT`, `HR_FACULTY_ROSTER`, `EMPLOYEE_DIRECTORY`, `MASTER_DEPT_DCODE_PARENT`, `SUBJECT_ATTRIBUTE`) — retrieved and screened; **no measure, key, or filter column required by this question exists only in them**. They are documented in §5.\n\n### Metrics (precedents) investigated\n`dw_3868`, `dw_4287`, `dw_3311`, `dw_3356`, `dw_4527`, `dw_1212`, `dw_3644`, `dw_1350`, `dw_2958`, `dw_2737`, `dw_3131`, `dw_2580`, `dw_3985`, `dw_1335`, `dw_2151`, `dw_2272`, `dw_1393`, `dw_4978`, `dw_3357`, `dw_3664`, `dw_3234`, `dw_2895`, `dw_4583`, `dw_4826`, `dw_4701`, `dw_2850`, `dw_3736`, `dw_3668`, `dw_3393`, `dw_3398`, `dw_4458`, `dw_3911`, `dw_4566`, `dw_4683`, `dw_4738`, `dw_4602`, `dw_1221`, `dw_3727`, `dw_4650`, `dw_4812`, `dw_3436`, `dw_4069`, `dw_3973`, `dw_4724`, `dw_1165`, `dw_3904`, `dw_4490`, `dw_5103`, `dw_3901`, `dw_2591`, `dw_1288`, `dw_4558`, `dw_4231`, `dw_4130`, `dw_1758`, `dw_3612`, `dw_3590`, `dw_1689`, `dw_4184`, `dw_4208`, `dw_3236`, `dw_3280`, `dw_2398`, `dw_3078`, `dw_3530`, `dw_3632`, `dw_4197`, `dw_4640`, `dw_1023`, `dw_41`, `dw_2158`, `dw_1049`, `dw_4061`, `dw_3163`, `dw_1766`, `dw_2224`, `dw_1301`, `dw_3237`, `dw_1692`, `dw_1471`, `dw_1833`, `dw_2461`, `dw_3609`, `dw_359`, `dw_3989`, `dw_3867`, `dw_4325`, `dw_2597`, `dw_2335`, `dw_1618`, `dw_4584`, `dw_2628`, `dw_4229`, `dw_2574`, `dw_4305`, `dw_4387`, `dw_1983`, `dw_2240`, `dw_3268`, `dw_3277`, `dw_3498`, `dw_3861`, `dw_4019`, `dw_4234`, `dw_2639`, `dw_3273`, `dw_3794`, `dw_50`, `dw_5150`, `dw_1474`, `dw_2924`.\n\n### Concepts / Column-concepts investigated\n`concept_course_material_programs`, `concept_subject_offering_facts`, `concept_department_dimension`, `concept_course_catalog_sources`, `concept_academic_term_dimension`, `concept_person_directory`, `concept_cip_program_classification`, `concept_iap_activities`, plus facilities/space/moira/time concepts (screened as unrelated to the requested measures); `col